# Build outputs, including the Core AAR that scripts/build-native-android.py writes to
# build/core/ (generated, never committed). Anchored on purpose: an unanchored "build/"
# also hid the Kotlin package directory build-logic/src/.../com/asterlink/build/.
/build/
/app/build/
/build-logic/build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
local.properties
captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.aar
*.jks
*.keystore
.idea/
*.iml
